    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>RPG that walks with romantic comedy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0What is &quot;Murasame&quot;?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are laughter, tears, and a little sadness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Here comes the slapstick fantasy love-comedy RPG!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929270/extras/d8ce6b958b7280071820d26ebb95d3b2.avif?t=1730927010\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0Charming heartwarming romantic comedy story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dichotomy between gag and serious!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The curtain rises on a romantic comedy that mixes in perfect balance and is sure to make your heart pound!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0Heroines with too much individuality</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All the heroines are troublesome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story accelerates in an oblique direction due to the outbursts of the super troublesome heroines with too many quirks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0Casual and easy-to-play game system</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The scenario is divided into fast-paced episodes and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The intermission between each episode strengthens the character and progresses the quest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For users who are not good at fighting, there is a &quot;cheat mode&quot; that starts at the strongest Level max!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0Additional elements for the Switch version included</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">EX scenario &quot;Seiou no Butokukai Hen&quot; added after clearing the main story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New characters &quot;Br\u00fcnnhilde, Sword Princess of the White Silver Sword&quot; and &quot;Glenn, Deputy Commander of the Order of the Holy Emperor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0Synopsis</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Excalibur, the sword-and-dragon dragon, suddenly appeared in the Highland Holy Empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before the overwhelming power of the Sword Demon Dragon and its absolute defensive barrier that nullifies all attacks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Knights of the Holy Order of the Highlanders were helplessly defeated, and a city was destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yuto, who lost his own sister, Yurihime, to the disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A girl with the only sword that can kill the avenging Sword Demon Dragon, &quot;Sword Breaker&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Satsuki, a young woman with a strong sense of humor.</p>",
